# Fieldline at a glance
{.lead} The same brief, split into tabs you can jump between. Each section becomes a tab.

## Overview

Fieldline turns scattered operational data into one daily digest your team actually reads.

- Connects the systems you already run.
- Writes a plain-language summary every morning.
- Delivers it where the team already looks.

---

## Compare

```mdp:compare
# Fieldline
badge: managed
note: A hosted digest, configured for you.
- Live the same day, with no setup work.
- Runs on our platform and account.

# Roll your own
badge: in your stack
note: A small script inside your own environment.
- Everything stays in your account.
- You maintain the code over time.
```

---

## Specs

| Item | Detail |
| --- | --- |
| Sources | CSV, email, webhook |
| Cadence | Daily or hourly |
| Delivery | Email, Slack, Telegram |
| Retention | 18 months |

---

## FAQ

The questions that come up most, kept short.

- It does not replace your systems; it reads from them.
- Your data stays in your own account.
- You can export every digest as a file.
